--- !u!114 &1593419591
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1593419589}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5076fe985908f84aa9eec478c7628f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playerMovementScript: {fileID: 1682816466}
  gameStateController: {fileID: 1682816467}
  textComponent: {fileID: 753070826}
  lines:
  - '*sigh* Another day of sitting around here with nothing to do but watch this
    store grow more and more empty.'
  - It's funny how I was one of the first things to make it into this store, yet
    I'm still here...
  - Actually... thats pretty sad.
  - I've always wondered what it would be like outside of my own little shelf, out
    there, in the real world.
  - But I dont think that dream could ever become a reality...
  - Like look at me! I'm the size of a human finger! It'll take forever to get out
    of here!
  - Wait... maybe I can use this key I found around the owner's desk the other day
    to get out of here...
  - At least it's worth a try!
  textSpeed: 0.05
